<Layout title="LaTasha’s Story | Home is Cookie" description="Meet the story behind Home is Cookie: LaTasha’s grandmother’s recipe, cookies made from scratch, and a Ruskin business built around sharing.">
<section class="wrap page-hero split"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE RECIPE BEHIND THE REASON</p><h1>From her grandmother’s kitchen<br/><em>to your table.</em></h1><p>LaTasha started baking alongside her grandmother. Over time, she adapted her grandmother’s chocolate cookie recipe into the cornerstone of Home is Cookie—a business built around bringing the experience of homemade cookies back to people’s tables.</p></div><Photo src="grogu-kitchen" alt="Grogu from Star Wars beside a KitchenAid mixer preparing green frosting in the Home is Cookie kitchen" width={1200} height={1034} class="photo" priority/></section><section class="section wrap split" style="padding-top:20px"><div><h2>Made from scratch.<br/>Baked for your order.</h2><p>Every order begins with scratch-made cookies. Whether it’s a tray for friends or printed cookies for a company event, LaTasha’s aim is the same: to share something personal, familiar, and homemade.</p><a class="button" href="/cookies/">Explore the cookies ↗</a></div><div><h3>Based in Ruskin,<br/>shared around the community.</h3><p>Home is Cookie offers arranged pickup in the Ruskin area and delivery to Sun City Center and selected Hillsborough County areas. Availability and delivery details are confirmed before payment.</p><a class="text-link" href="/ordering-delivery/">Pickup & delivery <span>↗</span></a></div></section></Layout>
